  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1253742/description_761a4b84-9432-4f3d-befb-0f28f4d4d515.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"212\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">整合幸运方块是对经典幸运方块玩法的全新诠释！拥有超过 100 种原版结果，在所有兼容性模组加载的情况下更超过 300 种，等待着您开启的惊喜数不胜数。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">掉落物包括物品、结构、生物以及大量其他事件。它们可能会造成相当大的破坏，因此请小心在何处开启它们！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">模组兼容性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Alex's Caves（亚历克斯的地牢）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Alex's Mobs（亚历克斯的生物）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Create（机械动力）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">The Outer End（外域）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Jellyfishing（水母垂钓）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">'Dustrial Decor（工业装饰）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Caverns and Chasms（洞穴与裂谷）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Blighted Beasts（疫病野兽）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Vouniern's Turrets（冯尼尔的炮塔）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Artifacts（神器）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Dimensional Doors（维度之门）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Rotten Creatures（腐化生物）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Compound V（复合维生素）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Jolly Boxes（欢乐盒子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Born in Chaos（混沌之子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">L_Ender's Cataclysm（L_Ender的大灾变）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Species（物种）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Opposing Force（对立势力）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Invincible: Conquest（无敌：征服）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">如需更多模组兼容性请求，请在评论区或我的 Discord 中留言！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/XQ3Bs7F\" target=\"_blank